      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "情けない話さ。かけがえのない妹の形見を\nくだらぬ賊に盗み出されてしまった。\n俺は今この街から離れる事ができぬ。\n奪還を代わりに頼むことはできないだろうか？",
        "official_en": "It is a shameful thing. Some good-for-nothing thief\nstole an irreplaceable keepsake of my little sister.\nI cannot leave this city right now. Might I ask you to\ntake it back in my stead?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
